  ('chatpati-strawberry', 'Chatpati Strawberry', 'Juicy strawberry and mandarin with a playful pinch of black pepper, on clean musk and cedarwood. Fun, fruity and full of personality.', 749, '/products/illustrations/chatpati-strawberry.webp', array['/products/illustrations/chatpati-strawberry.webp'], 'Chatpati Strawberry Eau de Parfum: an illustration of the SAHUMäRIO bottle with strawberry, black pepper', 'Strawberry · Mandarin · Grapefruit · Black pepper · White musk · Cedarwood', '50 ml', 'Fruity spicy', 'Juicy strawberry with a pinch of pepper', 'Daytime, college and parties', 'Women', true, true, 220),
