  ('mogra-elaichi', 'Mogra Elaichi', 'Fresh mogra (jasmine) with green cardamom, on creamy sandalwood, white musk and a touch of vanilla. A festive, very Indian floral.', 749, '/products/illustrations/mogra-elaichi.webp', array['/products/illustrations/mogra-elaichi.webp'], 'Mogra Elaichi Eau de Parfum: an illustration of the SAHUMäRIO bottle with jasmine, cardamom', 'Mandarin · Bergamot · Cardamom · Jasmine · Sandalwood · White musk', '50 ml', 'Floral spicy', 'Jasmine with green cardamom', 'Festivals, weddings and evenings', 'Women', true, true, 240),
